      "writtenOn": "2017-02-16T19:13:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is going to be removed altogether after HIDL. There is no saving config to wpa_supplicant anymore. They will automatically handled during connect.\n\nWe only save network in wpa_supplicant (after the first migration) when we need to connect and WifiConfigManager has no role in that. We did all of the config store refactor to take config management away from the connection process.",
      "parentUuid": "eb8baf00_fb71e185",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3220,
        "startChar": 19,
